// moonorm (<- SQLAlchemy / SQLModel). The parameterized query builder — the heart
// of SQLAlchemy Core — plus the execution layer: it emits SQL with `?` placeholders
// and a params list, so values are never interpolated into the string (injection-safe
// by construction). This root package is pure and compiles on every backend; the
// real SQLite `Driver` lives in the native-only `sqlite/` sub-package.
